{"products":[{"id":10347715264790,"title":"The Divot Tool","handle":"the-divot-tool","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStainless Steel Tee Divot Repair Tool\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003eA clean take on a course essential. The Gives Golf Divot Repair Tool is crafted from durable stainless steel and designed in the shape of a classic golf tee: sleek, minimal, and built to last. Lightweight yet strong, it slips easily into your pocket while delivering the leverage you need to properly repair ball marks and keep greens in top condition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAvailable in polished 304 stainless or heat-treated 17-4 stainless for a bronze finish. The bronze color comes from the heat treatment itself, not a coating, so there is nothing to chip or peel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003eFinished with subtle Gives Golf branding, this tool blends form and function for golfers who appreciate quality details. Whether you're fixing pitch marks between shots or gifting a fellow golfer, this is an everyday carry that belongs in every bag.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium stainless steel construction for long-term durability\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePolished 304 stainless or heat-treated 17-4 stainless in bronze\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBronze color comes from the heat treatment, not a coating\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTee-shaped design for a clean, modern aesthetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u00